{
  "description": "Small-world network engine — a ring graph whose edges the learner rewires on and off: degree centrality is recomputed live, weak-tie bridges are highlighted, and a complex-contagion diffusion step spreads adoption through one strong tie or a pair of weak ties, on a biology-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
